{"id": 10012060, "reference": "A12/00464/24", "publication_date": "2024-02-22T14:18:07.433Z", "modification_date": "2024-04-18T13:58:40.668Z", "country": "Sweden", "product_category": "ELECTRICAL_APPLIANCES", "product_name": "Children's camera", "product_name_specific": "Celly camera for kids", "risk_description": "The solders in the product have an excessive concentration of lead. (measured value up to 63% by weight). Lead poses a risk to the environment. \n\nThe plastic material of the cable has an excessive concentration of lead, bis(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate (DEHP), dibutyl phthalate (DBP) and short chain chlorinated paraffins (SCCPs) (measured values: up to 0.22%, 2.6%, 1.1% and 5.5% by weight, respectively). \nDEHP and DBP poses a risk to human health and the environment.\nSCCPs persist in the environment, are toxic to aquatic organisms at low concentrations and bio-accumulate in wildlife and humans, posing a risk to human health and the environment. Prolonged exposure to them through the skin may cause cancer.", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the requirements of the Directive on the restriction of the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment (RoHS 2 Directive) nor with the Persistent Organic Pollutants (POP) Regulation.", "country_of_origin": "People's Republic of China", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["Celly"], "model_types": ["KIDSCAMERA2PK "], "risk_types": ["CHEMICAL", "ENVIRONMENT"], "measures": ["PRODUCT_WITHDRAWAL_FROM_MARKET"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10112130, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10112131, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10112132, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10112133, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10112134, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10112135, "main": false, "embedding": ""}]}